--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ derived-to-base deduction: head element \(int\): SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ derived-to-base deduction: deeper base \(char\): SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
